{"id":1502,"bodyHtml":"<div><div><div><p>12月11日，我院韩秀兰老师在15107Z教室为全体研三学生开展“研三论文规范提升法”专题讲座，系统指导学位论文写作规范。</p><p>讲座以“一页纸结构法”为核心，围绕“研究问题—理论框架—研究方法—数据—结论—政策建议”的学术逻辑展开，详细讲解了论文各部分的撰写要点与规范要求。同学们随后依此结构进行论文自查，发现并梳理了自身论文在结构与逻辑上存在的问题。针对共性及个性问题，韩老师逐一解答并提出优化建议，帮助学生明确修改方向。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=bLlLE8nz7ioRvDoez-4LRlPM4NiLlLybL4vZU4rVnmCbL470gihFp2hmCIa0oSh7nSysoSysLlU8Ll7aU4-Yn7lsMNUPolnfnRlsL46VnlQFnmCaLlM2LzWFMRQ2MlCJqjfjo4OeoDiAvjAXvD80qIbtpYyPLRGig4CYM4lJqdhnx&oid=1579047909&tid=1005&nid=6275&e=.jpg\" xmlns:v=\"urn:schemas-microsoft-com:vml\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/9DE7971D41A0C22DE76D19DAD5737EEF/F601CF12/46F5F\" vheight=\"214.66998291015625\" vwidth=\"293.7300109863281\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=bMR9EaUzNbMmCYLemLinlQVM4LsM4QyVL7MVnzvDU4rknRv0gihFp2hmCIa0LSyZLYy4MkhVL8V2M4TfLmv8LRlPMRliUlW7ozl4M4-YnzAFL4lDn7nRUzfFL8-PoRWfgtXaQ4Oeo4xxC5WZq5MxgDTJQty0LzGaMSyDLmvigtA8pUhcc&oid=1579047909&tid=1005&nid=6275&e=.jpg\"></p><p>本次讲座内容详实、针对性强，有效解决了学生在论文结构与写作规范方面的困惑，为其顺利完成高质量学位论文奠定了坚实基础。</p></div></div></div>","bodyText":"","attachments":[],"image":"http://mkszyxy.nuc.edu.cn/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=bLlLE8nz7ioRvDoez-4LRlPM4NiLlLybL4vZU4rVnmCbL470gihFp2hmCIa0oSh7nSysoSysLlU8Ll7aU4-Yn7lsMNUPolnfnRlsL46VnlQFnmCaLlM2LzWFMRQ2MlCJqjfjo4OeoDiAvjAXvD80qIbtpYyPLRGig4CYM4lJqdhnx&oid=1579047909&tid=1005&nid=6275&e=.jpg"}